{"title":"学术发表活动","lang":"cn","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"出版活动","links":[]},{"kind":"heading","text":"机构出版活跃度分析","links":[{"label":"机构出版活跃度分析","href":"https://elibrary.ru/org_profile.asp?id=1205"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":"学者的个人标识符","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"标识符能够使作者与其科研活动的发表成果之间建立明确的对应关系。由于目前还没有统一的全球出版物数据库，因此每个引文数据库都有各自的标识符。","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"1. AuthorID РИНЦ (НЭБ ELIBRARY.RU) — 分配给俄罗斯科学引文索引（РИНЦ）平台上国家电子图书馆（НЭБ）的每个用户（读者）个人档案；SPIN-код — 在作者于 Science Index (РИНЦ) 系统中注册后分配。 注册链接","links":[{"label":"注册链接","href":"https://www.elibrary.ru/author_info.asp?rpage=&isnew=1"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"2. Scopus Author Identifier – 个人账户（Author ID）。爱思唯尔（Elsevier）旗下产品。","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"在 Scopus 中注册的指南","links":[{"label":"在 Scopus 中注册的指南","href":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RWMuolxd7Ikatrzdr87WOjqr5mCQ31Xt/view"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"注册链接","links":[{"label":"https://id.elsevier.com/as/authorization.oauth2?platSite=SC%2Fscopus&ui_locales=ru-RU&scope=openid+profile+email+els_auth_info+els_analytics_info+urn%3Acom%3Aelsevier%3Aidp%3Apolicy%3Aproduct%3Aindv_identity&els_policy=idp_policy_indv_identity_plus&response_type=code&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scopus.com%2Fauthredirect.uri%3FtxGid%3D68f7ad7f880","href":"https://id.elsevier.com/as/authorization.oauth2?platSite=SC%2Fscopus&ui_locales=ru-RU&scope=openid+profile+email+els_auth_info+els_analytics_info+urn%3Acom%3Aelsevier%3Aidp%3Apolicy%3Aproduct%3Aindv_identity&els_policy=idp_policy_indv_identity_plus&response_type=code&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scopus.com%2Fauthredirect.uri%3FtxGid%3D68f7ad7f88000e51082bd811d93c305a&state=userLogin%7CtxId%3DADCFCE579E65EDF8DFAC894C1D5162A3.i-015f439cfa713ff6b%3A7&authType=SINGLE_SIGN_IN&prompt=login&client_id=SCOPUS"},{"label":"注册链接","href":"https://id.elsevier.com/as/authorization.oauth2?platSite=SCscopus&ui_locales=ru-RU&scope=openid+profile+email+els_auth_info+els_analytics_info+urncomelsevieridppolicyproductindv_identity&els_policy=idp_policy_indv_identity_plus&response_type=code&redirect_uri=httpswww.scopus.comauthredirect.uritxGid68f7ad7f88000e51082bd811d93c305a&state=userLogintxIdADCFCE579E65EDF8DFAC894C1D5162A3.i-015f439cfa713ff6b7&authType=SINGLE_SIGN_IN&prompt=login&client_id=SCOPUS"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"3. ResearcherlD – 能够生成包含在 Web of Science 数据库中的作者完整文章列表。在网站注册时分配。","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"注册链接","links":[{"label":"https://researchid.co/admin/register","href":"https://researchid.co/admin/register"},{"label":"注册链接","href":"https://id.elsevier.com/as/authorization.oauth2?platSite=SCscopus&ui_locales=ru-RU&scope=openid+profile+email+els_auth_info+els_analytics_info+urncomelsevieridppolicyproductindv_identity&els_policy=idp_policy_indv_identity_plus&response_type=code&redirect_uri=httpswww.scopus.comauthredirect.uritxGid68f7ad7f88000e51082bd811d93c305a&state=userLogintxIdADCFCE579E65EDF8DFAC894C1D5162A3.i-015f439cfa713ff6b7&authType=SINGLE_SIGN_IN&prompt=login&client_id=SCOPUS"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"4. ID ORCID — 学者唯一标识符（Open Researcher and Contributor ID）。创建 ORCID 的主要任务是识别同名同姓的学者，因此每位学术论文作者都会被分配一个属于自己的唯一编号（ID ORCID）。该编号由16位数字组成：例如 — http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097。用于在 SCOPUS 和 Web of Science 中确认学术著作的所有权。注册链接","links":[{"label":"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097","href":"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097"},{"label":"注册链接","href":"https://orcid.org/"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"5. GOOGLE SCHOLAR PROFILE — 在 Google 学术搜索（Google Scholar）中注册可以提高您的著作在系统中的可见度，并允许您自动接收来自极广泛来源的关于您出版物被引用的通知。该服务被称为“Google Scholar Citations”（简称 GSC），中文称为“谷歌学术引用”或“谷歌学术中的作者档案”。Google 学术搜索是所有现有服务中覆盖范围最广的。“谷歌学术”对所有大学网站、高校知识库进行索引，因此几乎互联网上存在的所有著作都会自动进入 GSC 个人档案中。 注册链接","links":[{"label":"注册链接","href":"https://accounts.google.com/InteractiveLogin/signinchooser?continue=httpsscholar.google.com&hl=en&ifkv=ARZ0qKLwCdcmkvnkO1LyA5mlZCDgD1UASRpxsFsqAPEEbznkGd2ysZ9EP3V6YlGNul98ahbOgzIB&theme=mn&ddm=0&flowName=GlifWebSignIn&flowEntry=ServiceLogin"}]}],"variants":[{"id":"29c53c6f11db","lang":"ru","title":"Публикационная активность"},{"id":"29c53c6f11db-ky-c7a42","lang":"ky","title":"Публикационная активность"},{"id":"29c53c6f11db-en-9fb0f","lang":"en","title":"Publication activity"},{"id":"29c53c6f11db-cn-0fa3d","lang":"cn","title":"学术发表活动"}]}
